AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms TestingErrorLocal rule was triggered, indicating the local
AppNeta monitoring point itself encountered a testing error, rather than the network path
under test.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

A monitoring point resource issue, agent software fault, or local system/network
misconfiguration on the monitoring point, as determined by AppNeta's own monitoring
criteria for this rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
